   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "a and c merge into w at the midpoint of the\ndiagonal (then projected on the input surface).\nab is glued onto cb and ad onto cd, so the\nneighbours stay quads.\n\nfaces -1, vertices -1, edges -2: V - E + F unchanged.\nb and d lose one edge each; w collects 4 + 4 - 2.\nRotations and relaxation then repair the valences.",
   "originalText": "a and c merge into w at the midpoint of the\ndiagonal (then projected on the input surface).\nab is glued onto cb and ad onto cd, so the\nneighbours stay quads.\n\nfaces -1, vertices -1, edges -2: V - E + F unchanged.\nb and d lose one edge each; w collects 4 + 4 - 2.\nRotations and relaxation then repair the valences.",
