   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "s has valence 2: its two faces (blue, orange)\nshare two consecutive edges A-s and s-C.\nDissolve both edges and s: two quads become\none quad A B C D.\n\nfaces -1, vertices -1, edges -2: V - E + F unchanged.\nA and C lose one edge each (5 -> 4).",
   "originalText": "s has valence 2: its two faces (blue, orange)\nshare two consecutive edges A-s and s-C.\nDissolve both edges and s: two quads become\none quad A B C D.\n\nfaces -1, vertices -1, edges -2: V - E + F unchanged.\nA and C lose one edge each (5 -> 4).",
   "fontSize": 15,
